{
  "name": "B2B Lead Enrichment, EU Impressum, VIES VAT & Fraud Risk Check (Clearbit Alternative)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## B2B Lead Enrichment, EU KYB & Signup Fraud Check\n\nReplaces expensive Clearbit/Apollo enrichment seats with a single proxy-free HTTP call powered by **DirectAPI Labs** (`b2b-company-kyb-risk-api`).\n\n### Setup (1 Minute)\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://console.apify.com) and copy your API token (`Settings -> Integrations`).\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential named `Apify API Bearer Token`:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <your_apify_token>`\n3. Select that credential in **Enrich Company, EU VAT & Fraud Risk**.\n4. Click **Execute workflow** to test with `sipgate.de`, or activate the Webhook for live signups.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Triggers & Payload Format\nSend either a corporate domain or an email address via `POST` to `/webhook/b2b-lead-enrichment`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"founder@sipgate.de\",\n  \"domain\": \"sipgate.de\"\n}\n```\nOr use **Execute workflow** with the built-in test lead.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-triggers-help",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Triggers & Test",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What One `/v1/full` Call Checks\n- **Company & EU Impressum:** legal name, registration number, directors, city, tech stack, emails, social links.\n- **KYB Compliance:** live **EU VIES VAT** validation, **GLEIF LEI**, French Sirene, and **US OFAC SDN** sanctions screening.\n- **Fraud Risk (<250ms):** disposable domains, burner/alias MX servers, mail provider, SPF/DMARC, RDAP domain age (`riskVerdict`: `allow` / `review` / `block`).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-api-details",
      "name": "Sticky Note — KYB & Fraud Checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Routing & CRM Extensions\n- **Top Branch (`Qualified`):** `riskVerdict == \"allow\"` AND `sanctionsHit != true` -> attach **HubSpot**, **Pipedrive**, **Airtable**, or **Google Sheets** after `Format Qualified CRM Record`.\n- **Bottom Branch (`Flagged`):** disposable/high-risk or sanctioned hits -> route to **Slack** / **Telegram** security alert or block free trial signup.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-routing-extensions",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Routing & Extensions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        -60
      ]
    },
